    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "23. Aircraft",
    "ruleNumber": "23.04",
    "summary": "An **[AIRCRAFT](vsdata:core-rule/aircraft)** unit can charge or direct melee attacks only against **[FLYING](vsdata:core-rule/flying-models)** units. In the other direction, only **[FLYING](vsdata:core-rule/flying-models)** units may charge **[AIRCRAFT](vsdata:core-rule/aircraft)**, and only **[FLYING](vsdata:core-rule/flying-models)** models may target **[AIRCRAFT](vsdata:core-rule/aircraft)** with melee attacks.",
